    },
    {
      "chord_quality": "quartal",
      "function_role": "arpeggio-direction-alternation",
      "narrative": "Goodrick prescribes alternating arpeggio direction across successive M-Lode chord positions: arpeggiate up the first chord, then down the second chord, up the third chord, down the fourth chord, etc. (Chapter 6, p. 11; Chapter 15, p. 20).",
