    },
    {
      "chord_quality": "quartal",
      "function_role": "passing-tone-third-fill",
      "narrative": "When any voice within a quartal (or any M-Lode) voicing moves by a third between successive positions, fill that interval with a melodic passing tone. Applies to individual melodies, counterpoint, 3-part and 4-part chords (Chapter 13, p. 17-18).",
