    {
      "chord_quality": "quartal",
      "function_role": "density-floor-4-way-close",
      "narrative": "Begin all arpeggio and voicing exploration at 4-way close density. Look at all of the 4-way close options within the M-Lode \u2014 easiest area to explore that gives the best initial results. Seek open-string voicings (Chapter 15, p. 20; Chapter 16, p. 21).",
      "source_principle_ids": [],
