      "chord_quality": "quartal",
      "function_role": "octave-insertion-voicing-expansion",
      "narrative": "Octave insertion places an octave between any two voices within a 3-part or 4-part chord. Applies to quartal voicings as well: all of this applies to the 3-part 4th voicings as well. Named variants include Double Drop 2/Drop 4 and Drop 3 and 4 (Chapter 8-9, p. 14; Chapter 10, p. 15).",
