      "chord_quality": "quartal",
      "function_role": "voice-combination-practice",
      "narrative": "Play all 6 possible 2-voice combinations and all 4 possible 3-voice combinations of every 4-part chord. Joe's 2 Plus 2 Thing divides the 4-part chord into two 2-note groupings alternating as call-and-response pairs (Chapter 7, p. 12-13; Chapter 12, p. 16).",
